  "details": "Most users have Very Poor avatars blocked, but people using Very Poor avatars are often unaware of this. I've often talked to people who are scared to enable Very Poor avatars at all, even manually, out of fear that it may drop their performance dramatically, which is often the case.\n\nIf an indicator was added alongside someone's nametag that tells you if they have your avatar performance blocked, this would make that user more aware of how often their avatar is blocked by default. This could incentivize a lot more users to switch to a more optimized avatar, as it seems pointless to use an avatar that nobody wants to enable.\n\nTo be even more clear, the indicator should be different if someone manually blocks your avatar.",
